    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d370-a2">

                <pb facs="0577" n="489" xml:id="pg489"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No.
                    152.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Baron Stumm to Mr.
                            Newberry.</hi></head>
                <p>My <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Mr. Newberry</hi>: I hasten to inform you
                    that the German consul at Manila also exercises his functions on the Caroline
                    Islands, where we have neither consul nor consular agent.</p>
                <p>The arrangements reached with Spain concerning the Carolines does not contain
                    anything in regard to consular authorities established there. Therefore I can
                    but confirm your surmises.</p>
                <p>With my best feelings,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">B. Stumm.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
